5370 DEFine PROCedure make_targets
5380 REMark targets are only made if there was no error during compilation
5390 REMark to achieve this, a primitive approach is used:
5400 REMark a check is made whether an appsub menu item status is still selected
5410 REMark if it is, then the
5420   LOCal lp%,current_target%,tot_targets%
5430   tot_targets%=0                        : REMark no targets to make yet
5440   current_target%=0                               : REMark and no target yet
5450   FOR lp%=0 TO data_count%-2
5460     IF main_mfl%(lp%,0)=16
5470       REMark we're covering a new target
5480       tot_targets%=tot_targets%+current_target% : REMark show old target
5490       current_target%=find_target%(lp%+1) : REMark get new target we're covering
5500     ELSE
5510       IF main_mfl%(lp%,0)<>0:current_target%=0
5520     END IF
5530   END FOR lp%
5540   tot_targets%=tot_targets%+current_target%
5550   REMark at the end, here, tot_targets holds a bitmap
5560   REMark of targets for which compilation was ok
5570   IF (machines%&&1) AND NOT (tot_targets% && 1):RETurn : REMark generic was asked for but not compiled correctly!
5580   IF tot_targets%&&2:atari_target
5590   IF tot_targets%&&4:gc_target
5600   IF tot_targets%&&8:qx0_target
5610   IF tot_targets%&&16:qxl_target
5620   IF tot_targets%&&32:aurora_target
5630   IF tot_targets%&&64:java_target
5640   REMark IF tot_targets%&&128:ptr_gen_target  : rem no need for this
5650   IF tot_targets%&&256:qpc_target
5660   IF tot_targets%&&512:q68_target
5670   IF tot_targets%&&1024:qemu_target
5680 END DEFine make_targets
